	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wasure_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わざを　わすれさせたく　なったら
わしのことを　おもいだすのじゃぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>技を　忘れさせたく　なったら
わしのことを　思い出すのじゃぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：技忘れオヤジ
・いいえ選択→終了</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wasure_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なぬ？　そのポケモンは　ひとつしか
